        "text": "Fine Art with LibreOffice Draw\nWhether you\u2019re an aspiring graphic artist or just need a tool that lets you generate\nsimple graphics for use on their own, in a presentation, or elsewhere, LibreOffice\nDraw provides a host of drawing functions. If nothing else, it\u2019s a whole lot of fun\nto play with! Not everything in life has to be practical.\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Taking a tour of LibreOffice Draw\n\u2022 Working with Draw files\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
